{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"Roy enters, notices where Sabrine was, and joins her. \"Hi there, Sab. What's up?\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:10:53.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873251802638876772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
