{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'Ah, hello. Thanks for meeting me here. If I manage to get the memories... I might need help dealing with them.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:11:41.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252001553711124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"she nods. 'I apologise, minds was the wrong word to use. Consciousness? I'm not quite sure, honestly.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:12:11.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252129589063732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"Ed follows after Roy and waves at them, standing up taller to make their height difference with how they were before more noticeable","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:12:32.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252217476485131","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'Anyway. I was hoping we'd be able to help each other out. I know you said I shouldn't look into before I died, but maybe if I can regain memories of when I came into existence, it could help both of us - I'd get some closure and be able to move on, and you might get some data.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:13:23.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252430924615730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"she shakes her head \"I have not fabricated a mind, nor soul yet.  They are no more human than a dog.  I keep them alive while they give me good information, then I recycle them\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:13:38.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252491410694184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'Just since I don't know what I might experience, I invited some friends to help keep me calm. I hope that's alright.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:13:48.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252536591736832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'I might have been what you're looking for - but I don't know.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:14:16.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252654032228372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"Hey, Heore, right? I think we've met once. We had some weird thing sticking out of the street the other day here in Hamp'. Lunged at us and snatched some pigeons. One of yours, maybe?\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:14:20.294000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873252667969912842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
