{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'I hope you understand, if I'm going to consider having someone poking around in my brain... I need to be sure.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:33:05.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873257387807633448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"Yes.  I find it hard to get parts, so he often supplies for me.  Though, he seems to care for the dears like they are people.  Such a kind heart on that guy.  He really should toughen up.  But regardless hes a good friend\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:33:35.354000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873257512642686986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"At a guess, when I forgot to feed it, it broke out.  What the experiments lack in brains they make up with in brawn\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:34:15.059000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-06T17:34:20.192000Z","id":"873257679177547776","reply_to_id":"873257261340958740","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"'...no wonder. I haven't been needing food for long, but hunger is an awful feeling...'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:35:30.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873257996485013554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"Yeah to be honest, that thing was a bit freaky. It talked, called him its father, but the whole thing was also kinda weird when he seemed to care for it, but stayed behind when we went to pacify it. I'll be honest, it kinda pissed me off seeing how it acted like a child, and went mad, all while he stayed behind.\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:35:49.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873258076835282987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"no worry, seems to have been taken care of\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:35:54.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873258096313630752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"\"Dont think of it as a child.  More of a dog, or maybe rat.  It doesnt know what it thinks really.\" she pauses and flips to one of the last pages \"remove face to make it less human looking\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:37:01.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873258377025826877","reply_to_id":"873258076835282987","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"Roy shrugs. \"Maybe it's just something here, back home we treat our animals like family too, but I suppose I see what you meant. He said that wasn't made of any human parts, so did it like have a brain of its own or something?\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:38:45.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873258814772772894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"869930342037979147","content":"(a rat, huh.)\n'...it knew at least a little Common, though. It was able to communicate with us. And it was hurting.' she shivers again. 'It made me understand why people wanted me dead when I was a corpse. Out of pity.'","created_at":"2021-08-06T17:39:01.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873258879604113418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
